  "description": "After the tragic fates of her first three lives, Serena is determined to cruise through her fourth one. But to Serena's dismay, she's been reincarnated as a villainess hated by everyone, including her husband! Serena just wants to get a divorce and quietly start fresh, but with a talking bunny doll begging her to save the world and her husband suddenly acting more caring, nothing seems to be going to plan. When life has her cornered, will Serena be able to take the easy way out?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
